{"id": "882c4ac9-2e4e-48eb-938e-c2e6cf88afd5", "slug": "echo-harmonic-resonance", "title": "ECHO - Harmonic Resonance", "description": "Echo Harmonic Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"ECHO - Harmonic Resonance\"\ndescription: \"Echo Harmonic Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFAA00\"\n  secondary: \"#050101\"\n  accent: \"#330000\"\n  background: \"#050101\"\n  surface: \"#FFE8E8\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# ECHO - Harmonic Resonance\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 2; favorites: 1; remixes: 1.\nTags: background, animated, threejs, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nEcho Harmonic Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nEst. 2026 [ ] 45.0 RPM Mono Harmonic Resonance Produced By Echo Ind. 01 Crimson Wave 02 Velvet Noise 03 Solar Flare 04 Audio Core 05 Analog Soul 06 Distortion 07 Apex Tone 08 Sonic Bloom 09 Fade Out © 2026 ECHO INDUSTRI…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: The Geometry of Sonic Color.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFAA00, secondary #050101, accent #330000, background #050101, surface #FFE8E8, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>ECHO - Harmonic Resonance</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050101] text-white font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-rose-500 selection:text-white\">\n\n    <main class=\"relative h-[250vh]\">\n\n        <!-- Sticky Hero Container -->\n        <div class=\"sticky top-0 h-screen w-full flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#0a0202]\">\n\n            <!-- Record Assembly -->\n            <div id=\"record\" class=\"relative w-[85vmin] h-[85vmin] max-w-[800px] max-h-[800px] rounded-full shadow-2xl flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 80px rgba(255, 30, 80, 0.15);\">\n\n                <!-- Grooves Texture -->\n                <div id=\"grooves\" class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full\" style=\"background-image: repeating-radial-gradient(#050101, #050101 0.5%, #140202 0.6%, #050101 0.7%, #1a0303 0.8%);\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Anisotropic Metallic Sheen Layers -->\n                <div id=\"sheen-1\" class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full mix-blend-screen opacity-90\" style=\"background: conic-gradient(from 0deg, #000000 0%, #330000 12%, #ff0033 18%, #ffaa00 22%, #ffffff 25%, #ff0033 28%, #330000 35%, #000000 50%, #000000 55%, #330000 65%, #cc0033 72%, #ffaa00 77%, #ffffff 80%, #cc0033 83%, #330000 90%, #000000 100%);\"></div>\n                <div id=\"sheen-2\" class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full mix-blend-color-dodge opacity-60\" style=\"background: conic-gradient(from 90deg, transparent 0%, rgba(255, 170, 0, 0.2) 20%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) 25%, rgba(255, 170, 0, 0.2) 30%, transparent 50%, transparent 70%, rgba(255, 0, 50, 0.3) 75%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5) 80%, rgba(255, 0, 50, 0.3) 85%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Record Label -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-[42%] h-[42%] bg-[#1a0505] rounded-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center z-10 text-[#ff4d79] overflow-hidden shadow-inner\">\n\n                    <!-- Center Hole Background (Black) -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute w-[12%] h-[12%] bg-[#050101] rounded-full z-20 top-1/2 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Inner Ring -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-[#ff4d79]/20 m-2 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Label Content Container -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-between py-[12%] px-[10%] z-10\">\n\n                        <!-- Top Section -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-start\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-widest uppercase\">Est. 2026</span>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center text-[#ff4d79]\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs mr-1 opacity-50\">[</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:target-linear\" width=\"1.5rem\" height=\"1.5rem\" class=\"stroke-[1.5px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs ml-1 opacity-50\">]</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Main Brand Logo (ECHO) -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full flex justify-center items-center my-auto\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 330 120\" class=\"w-[90%] h-auto fill-current\">\n                                <!-- 'E' -->\n                                <path d=\"M 60 10 L 10 10 L 10 110 L 60 110 L 60 85 L 35 85 L 35 70 L 55 70 L 55 50 L 35 50 L 35 35 L 60 35 Z\"/>\n                                <!-- 'C' -->\n                                <path d=\"M 140 10 L 80 10 L 80 110 L 140 110 L 140 85 L 105 85 L 105 35 L 140 35 Z\"/>\n                                <!-- 'H' -->\n                                <path d=\"M 160 10 L 185 10 L 185 45 L 215 45 L 215 10 L 240 10 L 240 110 L 215 110 L 215 70 L 185 70 L 185 110 L 160 110 Z\"/>\n                                <!-- 'O' -->\n                                <path d=\"M 260 10 L 320 10 L 320 110 L 260 110 Z M 285 35 L 285 85 L 295 85 L 295 35 Z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Middle Metadata -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-1 scale-[0.8] origin-center\">\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                                <span>45.0 RPM</span>\n                                <span>Mono</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[#ffb700]\">Harmonic Resonance</span>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col text-right\">\n                                <span>Produced By</span>\n                                <span>Echo Ind.</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Tracklist Columns -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full grid grid-cols-3 gap-1 text-xs font-medium leading-tight uppercase text-center opacity-80 scale-[0.7] origin-top\">\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                                <span>01 Crimson Wave</span>\n                                <span>02 Velvet Noise</span>\n                                <span>03 Solar Flare</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                                <span>04 Audio Core</span>\n                                <span>05 Analog Soul</span>\n                                <span>06 Distortion</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                                <span>07 Apex Tone</span>\n                                <span>08 Sonic Bloom</span>\n                                <span>09 Fade Out</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Curved Bottom Text -->\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full transform origin-center -rotate-[15deg] pointer-events-none z-10\">\n                        <path id=\"bottomCurve\" d=\"M 12 50 A 38 38 0 0 0 88 50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\" />\n                        <text font-size=\"2.2\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-weight=\"500\" letter-spacing=\"0.1\" class=\"uppercase font-sans opacity-80\">\n                            <textPath href=\"#bottomCurve\" startOffset=\"50%\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n                                © 2026 ECHO INDUSTRIES. 404 RESONANCE AVE, SECTOR 7, NEO TOKYO, JAPAN\n                            </textPath>\n                        </text>\n                    </svg>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Scroll Overlay (Darkens record as you scroll) -->\n            <div id=\"scroll-overlay\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/0 backdrop-blur-[0px] z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Scroll Reveal Text -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center z-30 pointer-events-none px-6\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-5xl text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-8 pt-20\">\n                    <h1 id=\"reveal-title\" class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tighter text-[#ffe8e8] uppercase leading-[0.9] text-balance\">\n                        The Geometry of Sonic Color\n                    </h1>\n                    <p id=\"reveal-desc\" class=\"text-sm md:text-lg text-[#ff8888] font-normal max-w-2xl text-balance\">\n                        Immerse yourself in a landscape woven from analog warmth and digital exactitude. Engineered to push the sensory limits of auditory art.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // Register GSAP ScrollTrigger\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // Continuous Record Animations\n        // Spin the entire record slowly\n        gsap.to(\"#record\", {\n            rotation: 360,\n            duration: 20,\n            repeat: -1,\n            ease: \"none\"\n        });\n\n        // Spin the metallic sheen layers at different speeds for dynamic lighting effect\n        gsap.to(\"#sheen-1\", {\n            rotation: 360,\n            duration: 12,\n            repeat: -1,\n            ease: \"none\"\n        });\n\n        gsap.to(\"#sheen-2\", {\n            rotation: -360,\n            duration: 18,\n            repeat: -1,\n            ease: \"none\"\n        });\n\n        // Utility function to prepare text for masked staggered reveal\n        function prepareMaskedText(selector) {\n            const elements = document.querySelectorAll(selector);\n            elements.forEach(el => {\n                const text = el.innerText;\n                const words = text.split(' ');\n                el.innerHTML = '';\n\n                words.forEach(word => {\n                    // Outer mask container\n                    const mask = document.createElement('span');\n                    mask.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    mask.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    mask.style.verticalAlign = 'bottom';\n                    mask.className = 'mr-2 mb-1';\n\n                    // Inner animating word\n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.innerText = word;\n                    inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    inner.className = 'reveal-word translate-y-[120%]';\n\n                    mask.appendChild(inner);\n                    el.appendChild(mask);\n                });\n            });\n        }\n\n        // Prepare texts\n        prepareMaskedText('#reveal-title');\n        prepareMaskedText('#reveal-desc');\n\n        // ScrollTrigger Animations\n        const tl = gsap.timeline({\n            scrollTrigger: {\n                trigger: \"main\",\n                start: \"top top\",\n                end: \"bottom bottom\",\n                scrub: 1,\n            }\n        });\n\n        // 1. Scale down record and fade in overlay\n        tl.to(\"#record\", {\n            scale: 0.8,\n            opacity: 0.3,\n            ease: \"power2.inOut\"\n        }, 0);\n\n        tl.to(\"#scroll-overlay\", {\n            backgroundColor: \"rgba(10, 2, 2, 0.8)\",\n            backdropFilter: \"blur(12px)\",\n            ease: \"power2.inOut\"\n        }, 0);\n\n        // 2. Staggered Masked Reveal for Title\n        tl.to(\"#reveal-title .reveal-word\", {\n            y: \"0%\",\n            duration: 2,\n            stagger: 0.05,\n            ease: \"power4.out\"\n        }, 0.2);\n\n        // 3. Staggered Masked Reveal for Description\n        tl.to(\"#reveal-desc .reveal-word\", {\n            y: \"0%\",\n            duration: 2,\n            stagger: 0.02,\n            ease: \"power4.out\"\n        }, 0.4);\n\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "echo-harmonic-resonance.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/echo-harmonic-resonance.jpg", "source_name": "echo-harmonic-resonance-DESIGN.md", "views": 61, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T06:18:02.719006+00:00"}